From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 10:15:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Show a rolling window of recent publications, link out
 for the full list

The auto-generated page is now /publications/recent and shows only the current
year and the two before it (2024-2026 today). The window is computed at build
time in data/generatedPublications.data.ts, not in the browser, so the
server-rendered HTML and the client cannot disagree across New Year; the weekly
publications workflow rebuilds the site, so the window advances on its own.
Verified by building with a faked clock: 2027 gives 2025-2026-2027.

The data file still holds every fetched publication, so widening the window is a
one-line change (YEARS_SHOWN) and needs no refetch. 'All publications' now links
to CWI's institutional repository, from the page header, the page footer, the
selected-publications page and the homepage.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011yb3XX2yCMnhwLkSTaZ5sd
